  "R3_creation_ownership": {
    "finding": "held_open ended with released(owned_id or name), and owned_id was only assigned by an inspection AFTER the observation. A failure before that point left it null and the finally stopped and removed whatever held the NAME. The preflight was a read-only look, not a reservation, and the ordinary path adopted the id a name lookup returned.",
