    "measured_engine_behaviour": {
      "cidfile_written_by_the_creating_invocation": true,
      "second_run_against_an_existing_cidfile": "refused: 'container ID file found, make sure the other container isn't running'"
    },
    "correction": "--cidfile at a private per-run path that does not exist beforehand is the atomic ownership proof; unproved ownership issues NO stop and NO rm and records the exact uncertainty and the name asked for; every later inspection names the owned id and is checked to be about it; the name preflight is a labelled convenience",
